{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今日於將軍澳電視廣播城盛大舉行，全晚高潮落在由四大花旦領軍30位女藝員演出大型歌舞環 …</p><p></p>\n<p>《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》今日於將軍澳電視廣播城盛大舉行，全晚高潮落在由四大花旦領軍30位女藝員演出大型歌舞環節。當中即將53歲女星以極具震撼視覺效果造型壓軸登場，更在台上展現出令人目瞪口呆破格舉動。這位凍齡女王完美演繹跨越世代狂野魅力令全場觀眾深感震驚。</p>\n<h2>陳煒穿棗紅皮褸演繹《烈焰紅唇》</h2>\n<p>四大當家花旦聯同關嘉敏及黃嘉雯等共30位女藝員組成強大陣容同台獻技，透過多次性感變裝炒熱全場氣氛。作為表演環節絕對主力，陳煒以一身棗紅色皮褸內搭同色系低胸舞衣及長靴壓軸登場，氣場全開展現強勁壓場感。隨着強勁音樂節拍她在台上大膽拉開外套拉鏈大方展示健美身段，配合高高紮起長髮造型，舉手投足間充滿成熟嫵媚魅力。這身打扮讓觀眾立刻聯想到已故百變天后梅艷芳經典名作《烈焰紅唇》，完美展現極高專業度與震撼視覺效果。</p>\n<h2>傅嘉莉姚子羚陳敏之各展絕技搶鏡</h2>\n<p>除了女主角獨領風騷展現霸氣，其餘三位領軍花旦亦毫不吝嗇各自施展獨門絕技將氣氛推向頂峰。傅嘉莉頭戴銀色珠片頭飾配搭黑絲襪大跳誘人椅子舞展現狂野一面，而姚子羚演繹拐杖舞極具舞台觀賞性及戲劇張力。向來被稱為長腿天后陳敏之則以超短褲性感上陣，表演期間更毫不忌諱上演高難度碌地沙動作盡顯精湛舞技。30位成員在台上揮灑汗水配合整齊劃一絕佳表現，成功為這項年度盛事帶來極具衝突感強強對決。</p>\n<h2>凍齡視后陳煒大騷身段成全場焦點</h2>\n<p>距離生日只差短短日子，現年52歲即將步入53歲陳煒依然能夠在大型直播節目中保持如此極佳體態與驚人活力。要在高強度群舞中毫不甩漏並帶領一眾年輕女星完成演出，背後必須付出極大努力維持體能與身段。這種不畏歲月痕跡敬業精神將單純性感表演昇華至另一個層次。觀眾眼中看到不僅是表面性感狂野，更是她在演藝圈多年來堅持不懈所累積下來深厚功力。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚女王氣場完全不輸後生女</h2>\n<p>這場充滿視覺衝擊力超高水準演出隨即在各大社交平台上引發熱議，大批觀眾對壽星女凍齡外貌與爆發力感到嘆為觀止。網民紛紛留言大讚她保養得宜，有人直指「真係Keep得好好」，亦有觀眾被其舞台魅力折服並表示「狀態極佳，完全唔輸同場一班後生女」。更有不少忠實支持者認為她今晚表現無可挑剔，留下「壓場感第一，真係實至名歸嘅女王」高度評價。這段結合經典與創新歌舞表演在網絡上持續發酵，討論熱度依然居高不下。</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829392744539_4528198696aff06b66d423.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳煒 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829392744539_4528198696aff06b66d423.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829480243026_10187336926aff06b72aeaa.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳煒 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829480243026_10187336926aff06b72aeaa.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829566057991_7039210016aff06b8227f0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳煒 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829566057991_7039210016aff06b8227f0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829656778905_8208623936aff06b9173ca.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳煒 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829656778905_8208623936aff06b9173ca.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829758596984_8951259866aff06ba10481.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳煒 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829758596984_8951259866aff06ba10481.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p><figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829853685281_8311624376aff06bb1d527.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"萬千星輝賀台慶2026 陳煒 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179509829853685281_8311624376aff06bb1d527.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<p>還有什麼演唱會消息？<i></i></p>\n<p>無論是本地歌手還是外地歌手都即將在香港舉行演唱會，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%99%82%E9%96%93%E8%A1%A8-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A-plt-777443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">演唱會時間表及購票資訊</a></b>，包括<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/mirror%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E8%A3%9C%E5%A0%B4-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-816344/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">MIRROR演唱會門票兌換安排</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%AE%B9%E7%A5%96%E5%85%92%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-plt-801047/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">容祖兒</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E7%A7%80%E6%96%87-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E7%B4%85%E9%A4%A8-plt-807968/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭秀文</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E5%BC%B5%E5%AD%B8%E5%8F%8B-%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-786591/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">張學友</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E9%84%AD%E4%B8%AD%E5%9F%BA%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83%E6%BE%B3%E9%96%80-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-plt-835218/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">鄭中基</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E6%BA%AB%E6%8B%BF%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%94%AE%E7%A5%A8-plt-829876/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">溫拿</a></b>、<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/%E7%BE%85%E5%BF%97%E7%A5%A5%E6%BC%94%E5%94%B1%E6%9C%83-%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E9%96%80%E7%A5%A8-%E5%BA%A7%E4%BD%8D%E8%A1%A8-plt-835184/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">羅志祥</a></b>等。</p>\n<p>除了演唱會，還有什麼消閒娛樂活動？<i></i></p>\n<p>喜愛宅在家的話，觀看<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/netflix%E6%8E%A8%E8%96%A6-%E7%BE%8E%E5%8A%87-%E6%97%A5%E9%9F%93%E5%8F%B0%E5%8A%87-plt-576203/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Netflix劇集</a></b>和<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82/bl%E5%8A%87-netflix-plt-583838/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">BL劇</a></b>最好不過。如果喜歡外出走走的你，也可到這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E5%AE%A4%E5%85%A7%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-629923/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>室內遊樂場、溜冰場、自助烘焙店等盡玩室內活動。想要親親大自然，也可到離島走一走，即睇：<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF-%E5%81%87%E6%9C%9F%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E9%9B%A2%E5%B3%B6%E4%B8%80%E6%97%A5%E9%81%8A-%E6%A2%85%E7%AA%A9-%E6%9D%B1%E9%BE%8D%E5%B3%B6-gt01-420918/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">離島行程攻略</a></b>或是行山，這些<b><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E9%83%8A%E9%81%8A/%E9%A6%99%E6%B8%AF%E8%A1%8C%E5%B1%B1%E5%A5%BD%E5%8E%BB%E8%99%95-%E7%B0%A1%E5%96%AE%E5%88%9D%E7%B4%9A%E6%96%B0%E6%89%8B%E8%B7%AF%E7%B7%9A-org115-515293/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=%E5%A8%9B%E6%A8%82tag\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>路線簡易，新手也適合。</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\nTags :\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e7%83%88%e7%84%b0%e7%b4%85%e5%94%87/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">烈焰紅唇</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e8%90%ac%e5%8d%83%e6%98%9f%e8%bc%9d%e8%b3%80%e5%8f%b0%e6%85%b62026/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">萬千星輝賀台慶2026</a><a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/tag/%e9%99%b3%e7%85%92/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">陳煒</a> </p>\n<p>\n<i></i>\n<p>\n圖片來源：TVB資料或影片來源：<a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/3546321\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">原文刊於新假期</a>\n</p>\n</p><p></p>\n<a href=\"https://www.gotrip.hk/category/%e7%94%9f%e6%b4%bb/%e5%a8%9b%e6%a8%82/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">娛樂</a>\nNov 19 2026\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n<p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T15:39:28.567554+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1394,"images":6,"source":"GoTrip","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T14:25:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T15:53:11.392941+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T15:32:55.670476+00:00","content_hash":"8690de13869f286634fa5bc04b45e3e1b7c54806cd48214bf5e61ea460d055c5","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}